      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "src/\n├── main.rs\n├── routes.rs\n├── config/\n├── error/\n├── middleware/\n├── auth/\n│\n├── users/\n├── clients/\n├── employees/\n├── projects/\n├── project_stages/\n├── documents/\n├── document_versions/\n├── document_comments/\n├── document_approvals/\n├── messages/\n├── notifications/\n├── tasks/\n├── photos/\n├── payments/\n├── audit/\n├── media/\n└── leads/\n\nCada domínio segue, quando necessário:\nmod.rs • handlers.rs • service.rs • repository.rs • modelss.rs • dtos.rs • validators.rs • routes.rs\n\nmigrations/\nCargo.toml",
      "fontSize": 13.394722066254907,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
