      "text": "MEDIA\nPOST   /media/presign                 # upload direto quando houver object storage\nPOST   /media/complete\nDELETE /media/:id\n\nAUDIT (ADMIN)\nGET    /audit-logs\nGET    /audit-logs/:id\n\nPERMISSÕES (ADMIN)\nGET    /permissions\nGET    /roles\nPATCH  /users/:id/role\n\nSETTINGS (ADMIN)\nGET    /settings\nPATCH  /settings\n\nLEADS (ADMIN)\nGET    /leads\nGET    /leads/:id\nPATCH  /leads/:id\nDELETE /leads/:id\n\nObservação: rotas podem ganhar paginação, filtros e ordenação via query string sem multiplicar endpoints.",
