      "text": "PostgreSQL:\nusers • clients • projects • project_members • stages • documents • document_versions\nmessages • tasks • photos • payments • notifications • audit_logs\n\nStorageService:\nLocalStorage (MVP) → S3/R2 (escala)\nDB guarda storage_key, nunca o arquivo binário.\n\nMiddleware: autenticação • RBAC • request ID • rate limit • CORS • tracing • tratamento de erro",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PostgreSQL:\nusers • clients • projects • project_members • stages • documents • document_versions\nmessages • tasks • photos • payments • notifications • audit_logs\n\nStorageService:\nLocalStorage (MVP) → S3/R2 (escala)\nDB guarda storage_key, nunca o arquivo binário.\n\nMiddleware: autenticação • RBAC • request ID • rate limit • CORS • tracing • tratamento de erro",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
